      CorpusDeclaration {
        declaration: decl_ref(module_path: "strategy.node_rental", decl_name: "hetzner_wholesale_quantity_enquiry"),
      },
    ],
    note: "session vivid-deer-761: 0/4 floors is about our rows; Hetzner CAX supply derived from three dated this-account not-orderable readings; not a market-wide scarcity claim; original session finding: reseller quantity Unquoted; superseded 2026-09-11 by the reply to request 2026091103000909: no positive term quote, CAX Cloud dated NotOffered, dedicated Ampere unanswered",
  },
}

// SPLIT 2026-09-14 (audit folded): this item was one ExternalLead row gated on fleet-capacity-floor,
// which made provider DISCOVERY wait on a measurement it does not need. Discovery is now its own
// item (wholesale-requirements-discovery, dispatched now); this row is the BINDING OFFER, which does
// need a site quote and the floor; the production COMMITMENT is wholesale-production-readiness.
// OPERATOR'S FINANCE REVIEW 2026-09-14: the plan knew the BOM, the offer, the site band, the
// contract and the billing sequence, and could not pass or fail funding readiness at all. Two
// items: one dated reconciliation of deployable cash, and one admission per deployment that the
