  min_calendar_days: 3,
  active_effort_days: 3,
  execution_mode: OperatorExclusive,
  exit_criterion: "AVAILABLE DEPLOYMENT CASH, dated and evidenced, not headline net worth: current Mercury cash and company-card balance; current personal checking, CMA, money-market and brokerage balances and card balances; the $20,000 due-to-member disposition (finance.gunbai_ledger mt_collins_reimbursement); the Spark and Q80 ES lots posted on the entity book; the estimated-tax reserve (the 2026-09-15 New York payment and the undetermined January amounts); the member's runway reserve. Excluded by construction: retirement assets, the member's receivable from GUNBAI, unreserved tax money, unsigned customer promises, unapproved loans. The entity book's capitalization figure (~$60.9k after the two booked Mt. Collins claims) is provenance for this item, not its answer. REVIEW REPAIR 2026-09-14 (P1): this item waits on nothing - reading today's bank and liability state does not wait for the CPA's classification of the equipment deduction (cpa-commencement-determination is unavailable before the 2027 filing season); tax uncertainty enters as tax-reserve-standing, a conservative reserve, not as a gate on the reconciliation.",
