// M2b - PRIVATE COHORT (2026-11-23): 3-5 customers active; at least one unaided onboarding
// observed; minimal PAID path live (a 30-day paid-retention fact by Dec 19 requires a paid
// customer by ~Nov 19 - free credits cannot produce retained MRR).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

