  depends_on: [dep(id: "economics-regrounding")],
  relates_to: ["strategy.pareto_comparison_procedure", "strategy.ci_runner_economics"],
  item_relations: no_item_relations,
  status: NotStarted,
}


// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// SITING, MONEY AND COMPLIANCE (operator, 2026-09-04). Accumulate broadly now, consolidate
// later — the operator's explicit instruction. Three families enter here.
//
// SITING was represented only by colo-rfq, which produces QUOTES and stops. A quote is not a
// vendor, a vendor is not a signed date, and a signed date is not a rack you can put a server
// in. Worse, the fallback had no carrier at all: "if colo is not ready we soft-launch from the
// house" is a real plan the graph could not see, so nothing derived when it had to be decided.
// A fallback with no decision date is not a fallback, it is a hope.
//
// MONEY was absent entirely. Everything built in finance.personal_ledger and finance.gunbai_llc
// is invisible to every on-track derivation, so a 38,106.25 invoice and a January estimated
// payment were tracked by memory. The schedule cannot see what the ledger knows.
//
// GDPR had zero occurrences. SOC 2 is rostered twice; the regime that binds on the FIRST EU
// customer rather than at year end was not modelled at all.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

