data item_mt_collins_firmware_serviceability: PlanItem = PlanItem {
  id: "mt-collins-firmware-serviceability",
  workstream: Hardware,
  milestone: M3YearEndGate,
  rank: 30,
  min_calendar_days: 14,
  active_effort_days: 14,
  execution_mode: ExternalLead,
  exit_criterion: "A GENUINE UNRESOLVED PRODUCTION ITEM: Ampere Customer Connect rejected, ticket #7426 carrying three of six prepared asks, firmware-image capability unestablished, no evidenced first-party recovery path. Exit: exact BMC, BIOS, SCP and component firmware identities per node; an approved baseline; an authoritative image source established OR a typed FirmwareImagesUnavailable outcome; update and rollback/recovery paths established; one sample update or recovery exercise; a security-advisory monitoring owner and response deadline; buyer disclosure of unsupported surfaces; the explicit fallback under FirmwareImagesUnavailable - freeze the known baseline, cull a vulnerable or unrecoverable node, replace the whole node or board, make no patch promise. Production may be admitted under a bounded replacement-only policy, but the absence is visible in the contract and the SLO.",
  depends_on: no_deps,
  relates_to: ["strategy.owner_action", "strategy.wholesale_batch_floor"],
  item_relations: no_item_relations,
  status: InProgress { note: "Ampere support (Abhi) answered ticket #7426 on 2026-09-15 with four triage questions; the operator replied the same day, and that reply carried the three asks the original ticket did not: an authoritative source OR the ODM route for BMC, BIOS and SCP images (board firmware for a Foxconn platform is likely Foxconn's to distribute, so Ampere is asked to name the route rather than supply it); the channel-membership and rank-organization constraints behind OCP Mt. Jade section 7.4 Table 3, which the specification attributes to the processor and which is answerable without an NDA; and a route to NDA evaluation or a referral to the correct ODM or distributor. First check 2026-09-22. The 2026-10-15 fallback stands: record FirmwareImagesUnavailable and admit production under the bounded replacement-only policy." },
}

